,{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其七十八 原涉","author":"林同","text":"所当约于已，岂忍俭其先。\n道立南阳表，人呼原氏阡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28149,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其一八二 徐份","author":"林同","text":"父疾亦云笃，如何豁尔平。\n孝经惟泣诵，昼夜不停声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28150,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其一二八 徐庶","author":"林同","text":"不胜方寸乱，岂假二心持。\n忍矣王陵将，贤哉徐庶辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28151,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其十四 晋文公","author":"林同","text":"伐蒲君父命，校者是吾雠。\n披直寺人耳，锄麑信有谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28152,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其九 晋文侯","author":"林同","text":"嘉汝故锡汝，非将玉展亲。\n克昭乃显祖，追孝尔文人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28153,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其四十四 晋君子","author":"林同","text":"何怙复何尝，衔悲问彼苍。\n苍苍不可问，重使我心伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28154,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其四十三 晏子","author":"林同","text":"母家令足食，父族使安生。\n睦党可谓孝，能之惟晏婴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28155,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其一四三 桓冲","author":"林同","text":"不辞身作质，只为母须羊。\n此日江州牧，当年买德郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28156,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其五 泰伯","author":"林同","text":"为怜季有子，逆探父传贤。\n断发文身事，诬哉司马迁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28157,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其九十八 班固","author":"林同","text":"前烈知纯淑，孤踪愧眇蒙。\n果能笔叙传，不枉赋幽通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28158,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其十五 秦康公","author":"林同","text":"怀哉送舅氏，曰至渭之阳。\n念母如存意，悠悠寄二章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28159,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其八十七 耿国","author":"林同","text":"封侯谁不愿，顾我独何心。\n为忆父所爱，偏于少子深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28160,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贤者之孝二百四十首 其一七八 袁君正","author":"林同","text":"家人劝我睡，共说不眠难。\n官既未得差，眠时自不安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","pro